[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884762559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106456#issuecomment-2884762559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106456","id":2884762559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r8fu_","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T18:45:40Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T18:45:40Z","body":"Getting rid of a duplicate macro makes sense, but what was `DEBUG_METHODS_ENABLED` introduced for? ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884762559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884874804","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106456#issuecomment-2884874804","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106456","id":2884874804,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r87I0","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T19:36:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T19:36:42Z","body":"I'm not certain what niche it filled. It's existed since the engine became open-source, and its instantiation was exactly the same. The only difference is it was in `method_bind.h` instead of `typedefs.h`, which it moved to in #42826. I see no reason to keep it around, as even if it was specifically for methods, that's *still* been supplanted by `DEBUG_ENABLED`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884874804/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884881112","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106456#issuecomment-2884881112","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106456","id":2884881112,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r88rY","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T19:39:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T19:39:50Z","body":"Okay, so it's possibly just a remnant of pre open source godot. Makes sense to remove it if it doesn't have a niché.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884881112/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884941718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106456#issuecomment-2884941718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106456","id":2884941718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r9LeW","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T20:09:05Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T20:09:05Z","body":"Well one reason to potential keep this, is that it bears a different meaning to `DEBUG_ENABLED`, even if it's always enabled in the same case. It's about providing more debugging information in method bindings IIRC.\r\n\r\nBy removing this distinction, we're losing some intentionality there in what code gets flagged with `DEBUG_METHODS_ENABLED` specifically. Knowing it could open the way to e.g. enabling `DEBUG_METHODS_ENABLED` in release builds (with a SCons option) without having to enable `DEBUG_ENABLED` for the whole runtime.\r\n\r\nThat being said, we haven't done that in 10 years, and worst case we can always revert this PR if it was wanted in the future. I'm also not sure that new contributors after Juan have understood the distinction between `DEBUG_ENABLED` and `DEBUG_METHODS_ENABLED` and used it consistently where it should be.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884941718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886602448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106456#issuecomment-2886602448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106456","id":2886602448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sDg7Q","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T12:36:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T12:36:42Z","body":"If it were to be kept, we would need a dedicated sweep across the repo of what methods/variables should be using the \"correct\" macro. That feels like more trouble than it's worth, especially if we don't currently have a need for debug methods outside of debug builds","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886602448/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]